# The image is built from the repository root, because the game content and the server live in
# different top-level directories. Everything the build does not read is excluded here, or the
# context sent to the daemon is the whole repository -- the Flash client, the original C# server,
# the Redis binaries and every build directory, none of which the image contains.

*

!rust-server/Cargo.toml
!rust-server/Cargo.lock
!rust-server/crates
!rust-server/content
!godot-client/assets/xml

# Build output under the paths above, which would otherwise be sent and then ignored.
rust-server/target
**/*.rs.bk
